 en:{description:'Configure each area separately. Choose a section to keep options organized.',connections:'Connections and providers',connectionsHelp:'WhatsApp and other external services.',operations:'Campaigns and automations',operationsHelp:'Service and processing status.',users:'Users and permissions',usersHelp:'Team access, roles and permissions.',branding:'Company identity',brandingHelp:'Name, logo and brand appearance.',private:'Credentials and services',privateHelp:'Owner-managed service configuration.',restricted:'Only administrators can view these settings.',unavailable:'Status unavailable. Check the connection and migrations.',configured:'Configured / enabled',pending:'Pending / disabled',scheduler:'Recurring scheduler: not verified. Sending cannot be enabled here without secure server configuration.',secure:'Private credentials and scheduling are managed on the server. This panel displays status without exposing secrets.',labels:['Automatic sending','Automations','Worker protection','SendGrid API','SendGrid sender','Signed SendGrid webhook','Email unsubscribes','Evolution API']}
